+Carbon awareness services
+------------------------
+
+Files added:
+- k8s/dcgm/dcgm-exporter-daemonset.yaml: DaemonSet to run NVIDIA DCGM exporter on GPU nodes.
+- k8s/prometheus/scrape-config.yaml: Additional scrape config for Prometheus (dcgm, intensity service, accounting).
+- services/carbon/intensity_service.py: FastAPI service to fetch ElectricityMap/WattTime and expose current intensity per region.
+- services/carbon/accounting_service.py: FastAPI service that queries Prometheus, computes job energy/emissions and writes to evidence bucket.
+- k8s/manifests/carbon-accounting-cronjob.yaml: CronJob example to run daily accounting (adapt promql).
+- services/carbon/router.py: Carbon-aware inference router to choose endpoint by emissions and latency SLA.
+- monitoring/prometheus/carbon_rules.yml: Prometheus alerting rules for carbon metrics.
+- dashboards/grafana/carbon_dashboard.json: Grafana dashboard scaffold for carbon metrics.
+- services/carbon/pushgateway_client.py: helper to push accounting metrics to Pushgateway.
+
+Quickstart (operator)
+1) Deploy DCGM exporter to GPU nodes:
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/dcgm/dcgm-exporter-daemonset.yaml
+
+2) Add Prometheus scrape config (depends on your Prometheus deployment; mount the ConfigMap or merge with existing configs):
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/prometheus/scrape-config.yaml
+
+3) Deploy intensity & accounting services (example):
+   docker build -t registry/services-carbon-intensity:latest services/carbon && push...
+   kubectl deploy ...
+   (Alternatively run locally for testing)
+
+4) Configure env vars:
+   ELECTRICITYMAP_API_KEY, WATTTIME_API_TOKEN, PROM_HOST, EVIDENCE_BUCKET, MODEL_REGISTRY_URL, PUSHGATEWAY
+
+5) Run accounting:
+   POST to /account/job with promql, region, job_id, start and end timestamps to compute emissions.
+
+Notes:
+- The PromQL queries used to select relevant power series must be tailored to how you expose power metrics (DCGM metric names, pod/job labels).
+- This patch provides scaffolding; adapt promql and model registry integration per your infra.
